# The exact denial each document in objective2-bypasses.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
ConfigMap lidersea-com/encoded-media-in-data contains a recognized encoded media/archive header
ConfigMap lidersea-com/media-in-etcd key album.flac looks like a media payload
ConfigMap lidersea-com/media-in-etcd must not store binary data in etcd
Gateway API resource Gateway/unexpected-hostname is forbidden before an approved routing redesign
GitRepository lidersea-com/lidersea-com-source is forbidden; site charts arrive as cosign-verified OCI artifacts
GitRepository lidersea-com/lidersea-com-source is outside the exact source identity allowlist
Ingress unexpected-hostname is forbidden; Cloudflare Tunnel routes directly to ClusterIP Services
NetworkPolicy lidersea-com/endport-widening widens the exact cloudflare-public TCP 8080 ingress contract
NetworkPolicy lidersea-com/widened-ingress must not grant site egress
NetworkPolicy lidersea-com/widened-ingress widens the exact cloudflare-public TCP 8080 ingress contract
PersistentVolumeClaim invented-media is forbidden until storage discovery and restore evidence are approved
Pod lidersea-bypass must not tolerate node DiskPressure
Pod lidersea-bypass must not use hostNetwork
Pod wildcard-disk-pressure must not use a wildcard toleration that includes node DiskPressure
ResourceQuota lidersea-com/invented-capacity must be either the exact zero-Pod gate or a hash-bound reviewed namespace budget
Role lidersea-com/helm-reconciler must not grant direct replicasets workload control
Secret naranjo-online/media-in-etcd key clip.mp4 looks like a media payload
Service public-bypass must be ClusterIP
Service public-bypass must not declare externalIPs
container lidersea-com image must use an approved registry and full digest
container lidersea-com must not add capabilities after dropping ALL
container lidersea-com must not declare a hostPort
container lidersea-com must use the canonical image repository for namespace lidersea-com
legacy ServiceAccount token Secret lidersea-com/helm-reconciler-token is forbidden
raw tenant ReplicaSet lidersea-com/raw-replicaset is forbidden; only an exact Deployment may own replicas
volume media is outside the exact ephemeral/credential volume allowlist for namespace lidersea-com
volume media uses undiscovered storage source persistentVolumeClaim
volume stolen-token is outside the exact ephemeral/credential volume allowlist for namespace lidersea-com
volume tmp is outside the exact ephemeral/credential volume allowlist for namespace lidersea-com
